* AD8237 Instrumentation Amplifier
VCC VCC 0 5
VEE VEE 0 0
VREF REF 0 2.5
VBW BW 0 5

V1 IN 0 SINE(0 20m 1k) AC 1
E1 INP REF IN 0 0.5
E2 INN REF IN 0 -0.5

X1 BW INP INN VEE REF FB OUT VCC AD8237

R2 OUT FB 9k
R1 FB REF 1k

.ac dec 10 100 10k
.tran 0 10m 5m
.measure ac gain_db FIND VdB(OUT) AT 1k

.end
